Title: Episode 1 — Present Tense, Level 1: Simple Sentences (Regular Verbs)
Credit: Spanish School
Author: Spanish School
verbsCovered: hablar, llevar, vivir, mirar, esperar, buscar, trabajar, escribir, comer, beber, abrir, comprar, pagar, estudiar, aprender, enseñar, caminar, correr, cocinar, lavar, leer
Abstract: Fifty simple present-tense sentences built only from regular verbs and the core nouns. Each Spanish sentence is spoken twice, then the English, then a pause to repeat.

NARRADOR
Welcome to Spanish School. We are drilling the present tense. You will hear each sentence twice. Then a pause — say it out loud. Then you hear the English. Let us begin.

MAESTRA
Yo hablo con mi amigo.

MAESTRA
Yo hablo con mi amigo.

NARRADOR
I speak with my friend.

[[<pause length="4s"/>]]

MAESTRA
Tú hablas por teléfono.

MAESTRA
Tú hablas por teléfono.

NARRADOR
